{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gangster semi-comedy in a Tarantino-esque style, featuring showdowns between organized crime groups and sharp dialogues infused with black humor, where gameplay offers freedom to explore sandbox levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of &quot;Glowing Lamps&quot;, there is no single correct way to achieve your goal. Act stealthily, use force, or utilize social skills \u2013 it\u2019s up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action</strong> \u2013\u00a0eliminate enemies loudly in a fist fight, use the environment to create chaos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong> \u2013 quietly take enemies down, distract them with a thrown bottle, peek or eavesdrop on plot information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogues and Quests\u00a0</strong>\u2013 talk to characters and unlock power-ups, shortcuts or vital plot info by completing their tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/1deea24cda9d082ef4569a3dee81d56e.poster.avif?t=1769600788\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/1deea24cda9d082ef4569a3dee81d56e.webm?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/1deea24cda9d082ef4569a3dee81d56e.mp4?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Use the Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore expansive, content-rich, interconnected, sandbox-like levels where you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow up propane canisters and have fun with explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bottles to distract  or knock out an opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter rooms through ventilation shafts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move along wires using a grappling hook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide bodies in trash bins and cabinets or hide yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create smoke screens for camouflage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze opponents with a fire extinguisher, then throw it at them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read notes filled with lore or useful information (totally optional, of course).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain abilities from eating bars, including time slowing and berserker strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a game of backgammon because why not?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/f36ef26a06dd4a0504acb8962e1cfeeb.poster.avif?t=1769600788\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/f36ef26a06dd4a0504acb8962e1cfeeb.webm?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/f36ef26a06dd4a0504acb8962e1cfeeb.mp4?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions have consequences. Beat up those who pay for protection? Be prepared for local bandits to arrange a &quot;meeting&quot; for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world operates by real rules. Any NPC can be attacked. The money you pay can be found in the seller's wallet. Anything that can be bought can also be stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.poster.avif?t=1769600788\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.webm?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.mp4?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in alternative 1990s in City N. You play as Anton, a leading engineer of rods energy technology \u2013 a unique technology experiencing a revival after a period of decline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among Soviet  panel buildings of City N, gopniks and gangs call the shots on the streets. Here, everyone tries to survive by their own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.poster.avif?t=1769600788\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.webm?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.mp4?t=1769600788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652160?t=1769600788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/3d5f5299408e2ec11528747be34b4023f7fa